    <h1 class="page-title">Technology Roadmap &amp; Vendor Selection</h1>
    <p class="hero-statement">A multi-year investment roadmap with prioritised initiatives, dependency mapping, and vendor shortlists ranked by fit — not by who called first.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
