<section class="content-section reveal">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 lg:px-6">
    <div class="prose-content">
      <p>The problem: technology decisions are often made one purchase at a time, with no view of how today's choice constrains tomorrow's. A platform bought in isolation can lock out future options, duplicate capabilities, or commit your organisation to a path that no longer fits.</p>

      <p>The approach: MEAICON maps your business objectives to a multi-year technology investment plan. We sequence initiatives by dependency and value, then run a structured vendor evaluation for each major decision. Every recommendation is defensible because it follows a transparent, repeatable framework.</p>

      <p>Outcomes: a roadmap document with quarterly milestones, a vendor evaluation framework with scored shortlists, and a build-versus-buy analysis for each major capability. You get a plan you can present to a board, a regulator, or a procurement committee with confidence.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

